Walk planning on a neutral surface with folded anonymous relief map and a pair of scuffed footwear; a round carabiner as a subtle shape detail, no invented photograph of the rock arch. Make one original ultra-realistic live editorial studio photograph for the independent magazine Kompas. Wide landscape about 1.9:1, central subject inside the middle 75% for a consistent crop; clear plausible optics and readable shadow detail. Real controlled directional daylight, neutral-warm color, tactile ordinary materials, one purposeful subject and an interesting but restrained sense of depth. Photographic, no layout or decorative graphics. No people, faces, hands, silhouettes, visible lettering, numbers, logos, neon, fake interface or watermarks.
